{"version":1,"content":"<p>前港姐冠軍朱晨麗今年7月正式約滿，結束與無綫電視（TVB）長達15年的賓主關係。</p><p>重獲自由身的她狀態大好，近日被發現低調現身星級中菜館。</p><p>照片中的朱晨麗身穿粉紅色休閒連身裙，頭戴白色棒球帽，打扮隨性卻掩不住好氣色，更與米芝蓮主廚陳天龍並排合照，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.326438+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T12:01:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_hash":"4a482583e50ab34a28d50c33235d3feed847b9fe665c6c748c4d066e90ead7df","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}